#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-settings.php:1571
msgid ""
"This option adds rate limit when submitting the change password form in the "
"Account page. Users are only allowed to submit 1 request per 30 minutes to "
"prevent from any brute-force attacks or password guessing with the form."
msgstr "此選項增加了在帳戶頁面提交更改密碼表單時的速率限制。每 30 分鐘只允許使用者提交 1 次請求，以防止任何暴力攻擊或使用表單猜測密碼。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-metabox.php:2365
msgid ""
"This option allows you to pre-fill the field with a default value prior to "
"the user entering a value in the field. Leave blank to have no default value"
msgstr "此選項允許您在使用者在欄位中輸入數值之前，預先在欄位中填入預設值。留空表示沒有預設值"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-metabox.php:2491
msgid ""
"This option allows you to set whether or not the user can edit the "
"information in this field. The site admin can edit all fields regardless of "
"the option set here."
msgstr "此選項可讓您設定使用者是否可以編輯此欄位的資訊。無論在此設定的選項為何，網站管理員都可以編輯所有欄位。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-metabox.php:2465
msgid ""
"This option allows you to set whether the field must be filled in before the "
"form can be processed."
msgstr "此選項可讓您設定是否必須填寫欄位才能處理表格。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-settings.php:1596
msgid ""
"This option lets you specify blacklist of words to prevent anyone from "
"signing up with such a word as their username."
msgstr "此選項可讓您指定字詞黑名單，以防止任何人使用此類字詞作為其使用者名稱註冊。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-settings.php:2230
msgid ""
"This option lets you specify the choice callback functions to prevent anyone "
"from using 3rd-party functions that may put your site at risk."
msgstr "此選項可讓您指定選擇的回呼函數，以防止任何人使用可能會使您的網站遭受風險的第三方函數。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-settings.php:1578
msgid ""
"This option makes possible to reset password only for approved user. Is used "
"to prevent from any spam email attacks from not approved users."
msgstr "此選項只可讓已核准的使用者重設密碼。用來防止未經核准使用者的垃圾郵件攻擊。"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-metabox.php:1914
msgid ""
"This option overrides \"Date User-Friendly Format\" option. See https://www."
"php.net/manual/en/function.date.php"
msgstr "此選項覆寫「日期使用者友善格式」選項。請參閱 https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php"

#: includes/admin/core/class-admin-settings.php:1453
